				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">Digital Library of the Archdiocese of Cologne and Cathedral Library</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://digital.dombibliothek-koeln.de/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The Digital Library of the Archdiocese of Cologne and Cathedral Library contains mainly digitised medieval manuscripts from the Diocesan and Cathedral libraries, as well as historical books and incunabula from the historical collections of this library, focusing primarily on topics related to the Church of Cologne and its history. It spans a long period of Western European Christian and cultural history. In addition, you will find numerous publications from the institutional series ‘Libelli Rhenani’ and the journal ‘Analecta Coloniensia’ as well as recent publications by the Archdiocesan Vicariate General and its departments. The digital collections available here are continuously expanded and updated.</r3d:description>
